title: "The Interrogative Conscience: Fourteen-Document Core"
type: generic
authors:
  - family-names: Vargo
    given-names: Thomas
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-ND-4.0
abstract: >-
  A fourteen-document, non-operational and non-authoritative mathematical atlas
  of structural questions for advanced intelligence, including a 112-question
  Master Question Registry, examination overlays, dependency relations, open
  dependencies, and a synthesis atlas.
keywords:
  - interrogative conscience
  - advanced intelligence
  - structural questions
  - machine-readable research registry
  - dependency atlas
  - model uncertainty
  - irreversibility
  - non-authority
